6. The software must allow users to share news articles and summaries through various social media platforms or direct sharing options.
7. The application must provide a user-friendly interface for browsing personalized news content efficiently.
8. The system must have a feedback mechanism to improve content delivery and user experience based on user interactions and preferences.
